                default 30
                range 5 60
                depends on MYVENDOR_DVFS
                ---help---
                    Projected idle at the lower gear. Must be above IDLE_UP
                    so adjacent gears do not bounce.

            config MYVENDOR_DVFS_INTERACTIVE_MHZ
